    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Isekai Uncle Gathers a Harem of Beauties!~</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world of sword and sorcery, I was a despised, plain-looking, good-for-nothing middle-aged man. Just when I decided to &quot;lie flat&quot; and give up on life, I was betrayed and used as cannon fodder...<br>I... I refuse to accept this!<br>A life of waking up whenever I want, counting money until my hands cramp, and being surrounded by tons of beautiful women...<br>Even an old guy like me can make that happen\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447430/extras/6dbe7cbe40ab88dda7fbed4caea3f8e1.poster.avif?t=1751992124\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447430/extras/6dbe7cbe40ab88dda7fbed4caea3f8e1.webm?t=1751992124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447430/extras/6dbe7cbe40ab88dda7fbed4caea3f8e1.mp4?t=1751992124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features: Multiple Heroines + Lighthearted Fantasy Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven experience with gameplay in a supporting role, its dynamic narrative framework presents a unique charm, blurring the line between a game and an anime.<br>The immersive story is based on the original, epic-length light novel. The game is released in an anime-style seasonal format. The first season of <i>Ling Xing Wu Yu</i> (\u9886\u661f\u7269\u8bed) alone contains 350,000 words of pure light novel content.<br>Many unique and distinctive heroines will continue to appear as the exciting story unfolds... </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Isekai Uncle Gathers a Harem of Beauties!~</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world of sword and sorcery, I was a despised, plain-looking, good-for-nothing middle-aged man. Just when I decided to &quot;lie flat&quot; and give up on life, I was betrayed and used as cannon fodder...<br>I... I refuse to accept this!<br>A life of waking up whenever I want, counting money until my hands cramp, and being surrounded by tons of beautiful women...<br>Even an old guy like me can make that happen\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447430/extras/6dbe7cbe40ab88dda7fbed4caea3f8e1.poster.avif?t=1751992124\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447430/extras/6dbe7cbe40ab88dda7fbed4caea3f8e1.webm?t=1751992124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447430/extras/6dbe7cbe40ab88dda7fbed4caea3f8e1.mp4?t=1751992124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features: Multiple Heroines + Lighthearted Fantasy Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven experience with gameplay in a supporting role, its dynamic narrative framework presents a unique charm, blurring the line between a game and an anime.<br>The immersive story is based on the original, epic-length light novel. The game is released in an anime-style seasonal format. The first season of <i>Ling Xing Wu Yu</i> (\u9886\u661f\u7269\u8bed) alone contains 350,000 words of pure light novel content.<br>Many unique and distinctive heroines will continue to appear as the exciting story unfolds... </p>",
